      "writtenOn": "2019-09-23T18:03:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You shouldn\u0027t need regular expressions here, but I\u0027m having a hard time following the logic to suggest a replacement.  It appears to be looking for module_cflags.* files in interOutputs, stripping off just the filename, and then reconstructing the original paths?  Why match at all, since you know that interOutputs only has module_cflags.* files, and you know you want to concatenate all of them?\n\nIf you want just the cflags/module_cflags.txt.1 part and you make interOutputs and android.Paths you can use s.interOutputs[1].Rel(), and if you want just the filename  you can use s.interOutputs[1].Base().",
      "revId": "884fb23f297d10581c26bbc33f80970b0ca4030b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
